# Travix – AI-Powered Travel Platform

## Project Summary

Travix is an intelligent travel platform that serves as a personal AI travel advisor — from initial inspiration to end-to-end booking. The app combines conversational AI planning, real-time offer search, interactive trip management, and on-trip support into a single, cohesive experience.

---

## Problem Statement

Travel planning today is fragmented across dozens of websites, apps, and services. Travelers must manually compare flights, trains, hotels, activities, and car rentals — often losing track of options, budgets, and preferences. Existing tools either focus on a single booking category or lack the intelligence to adapt to a traveler's real wishes.

Travix solves this by providing a single AI-powered assistant that understands natural language, respects user preferences strictly, searches for real data, and manages the entire trip lifecycle.

---

## Target Audience

- Leisure travelers (couples, families, solo) who want a personalized, stress-free planning experience
- Users who value transparency (real offers, no fabricated data)
- Travelers who want to resume interrupted planning sessions at any time

---

## Core Principles

1. **User wishes are sacred** — If a user says "train to Paris," Travix shows only trains, never flights. Budget, dates, transport mode, and accommodation type are always respected.
2. **No fabricated data** — Travix uses live internet search to find real hotels, flights, trains, and activities. If no results exist, Travix says so honestly.
3. **Conversational, step-by-step** — The AI asks one question at a time, never overwhelming the user with multiple simultaneous questions.
4. **Never lose work** — Interrupted planning sessions are auto-saved as drafts with full chat history.
5. **Everything is interactive** — Every trip component (flight, hotel, train, activity) is clickable and editable through the AI chat.

