## Key Features

### 1. AI Travel Advisor (KI-Chat)
- Messenger-style chat interface with animated Travix avatar (states: greeting, thinking, writing, searching, happy, error)
- One-question-at-a-time dialogue flow for trip planning
- Strict transport mode enforcement (train → trains only, flight → flights only, bus/ferry/car rental equally strict)
- Real data search via `add_context_from_internet` — no fabricated offers, hotels, or train connections
- Voice input (browser TTS) and text-to-speech output
- Quick reply suggestions based on context
- Trip summary card with inline "save & view" action

### 2. Real Hotel Search
- Searches multiple real hotels (minimum 3) with full details:
  - Hotel name, star rating, user rating, number of reviews
  - Price per night + total price
  - Location, distance to station/airport
  - Room categories, breakfast included
  - Amenities, cancellation policy
  - Multiple images (Unsplash)
  - Direct booking URL
- Hotels displayed as comparable cards; user selects one → auto-integrated into trip

### 3. Real Train/Bus/Ferry Search
- Echte Verbindungen with:
  - Departure/arrival stations, times, duration
  - Transfers, operator/bahnunternehmen
  - Price, available classes, baggage info
- If no connection found → honest message + alternatives

### 4. Interactive Trip Plan (BuchungsSeite)
- Dynamic, not static — every component is clickable
- Sections: Flights ✈️, Trains 🚆, Hotels 🏨, Car Rentals 🚗, Activities 🎟️
- Empty sections show "Noch kein Hotel ausgewählt" with a "+ Suchen" button → opens KI-Chat with context
- Each item has a "Beim Anbieter buchen" (book at provider) button
- Manual edit mode (add/remove activities, adjust prices)
- Total cost breakdown (transport, accommodation, activities, car)
- Real-time cost recalculation when items are added/removed

### 5. Trip Checklist (13-Point)
- Interactive checklist covering: outbound flight, return flight, accommodation, activities, car rental, restaurants, insurance, travel documents, packing, airport transfer, and more
- Auto-detects completion status from trip data (e.g., hotel exists → "accommodation" marked done)
- Each checklist item is clickable → opens KI-Chat to plan that specific component
- "Mit Travix weiterplanen" button for full trip editing

### 6. Auto-Save & Drafts (Reiseentwürfe)
- Chat history + trip data auto-saved to Trip entity on session interruption (page leave, app close)
- Drafts page shows:
  - Trip destination, image, budget, dates
  - Progress bar (%) based on completed planning components
  - Status badges (🚆 Zug ✓ / 🏨 Hotel offen / 🎟️ Aktivitäten offen)
  - "Planung fortsetzen" button → resumes KI-Chat with full history at the exact point of interruption
- Drafts can be paused, duplicated, finalized, or deleted

### 7. Holiday Mode (Urlaubsmodus)
- Real-time, on-trip AI support
- Photo/image analysis — user uploads a photo (e.g., restaurant menu, landmark, sign) and Travix analyzes it with InvokeLLM vision
- Context-aware assistance based on the active trip
- Daily itinerary display and quick actions

### 8. Deal Finder Agent
- Autonomous AI agent with web search capabilities
- Finds deals on flights, hotels, and packages
- WhatsApp/Telegram channel support

### 9. Flight Search (Duffel Integration)
- Flight search wizard integrated into KI-Chat flow
- IATA code resolution for origin/destination
- Passenger details (ages, cabin class, one-way/round-trip)
- Selected flight auto-integrated into trip plan
- *Note: Full Duffel backend integration requires Builder+ subscription*

### 10. Trip Management
- **Reiseentwürfe** (drafts): interrupted/paused planning sessions
- **Meine Reisen** (booked): confirmed trips
- **Warenkorb** (cart): centralized booking cart with grouped summaries and real-time totals
- **Dashboard**: overview of trips, budgets, favorites, loyalty points
- **Favoriten**: saved destinations
- **Preisalarme**: price alerts for destinations
- **Reisekalender**: trip calendar view
- **Reisebudget**: budget breakdown with charts
- **Kartenansicht**: interactive map (Leaflet) with trip markers
- **Aktivitäten**: aggregated activity view across all trips

### 11. User Account
- Profile with travel preferences (styles, budget, dietary, home airport)
- Travix Premium subscription tier
- Rewards/loyalty program
- Settings & help pages
- Row-level security on all user-specific entities (Trip, Cart, Favorite, PriceAlert, SavedOffer)

