## Technical Architecture

### Frontend
- **React + Vite + Tailwind CSS**
- **shadcn/ui** component library
- **Framer Motion** for animations
- **Recharts** for budget charts
- **React-Leaflet** for maps
- **lucide-react** for icons
- Design system: Sora (heading/display) + Inter (body), navy/teal/gold color palette

### Backend
- **Base44 BaaS** (auth, database, hosting)
- **Entities**: Trip, Cart, SavedOffer, PriceAlert, Favorite, User (built-in)
- **Row-Level Security (RLS)**: All user-specific entities enforce `created_by_id: {{user.id}}` on create/read/update/delete
- **AI Integration**: `InvokeLLM` with `gemini_3_flash` model + `add_context_from_internet` for real-time web search
- **File handling**: UploadFile, UploadPrivateFile, CreateFileSignedUrl
- **TTS/STT**: GenerateSpeech, TranscribeAudio, browser SpeechSynthesis API

### AI Logic
- LLM prompt enforces: transport mode strictness, real data search (no fabrication), one-question-at-a-time flow, full hotel/train schemas
- JSON schema (`FULL_TRIP_SCHEMA`) defines structured response: reply text, trip object (with offers, transport, accommodation, itinerary, total_cost, pre_trip), and flight_search parameters
- Auto-save: chat history persisted to Trip entity on component unmount via refs + cleanup useEffect

