## Known Limitations & Future Work

1. **Direct booking** — Currently redirects to provider websites; in-app booking is in development
2. **Duffel flight API** — Backend function drafted but requires Builder+ subscription for deployment
3. **Background processing** — Long-running searches can't continue in the background without backend functions (Builder+)
4. **Push notifications** — Not yet supported; next-best alternative is in-app notification on app reopen

